  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EeQU5Eq.png\" width=\"650\"/>\n</p>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3073\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/cmee6m.jpg\" width=\"800\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n“氧化铜工具”模组添加了会随着耐久度磨损而发生氧化的工具，外观会从光亮的铜色逐渐变为带有绿色铜锈！这是一种简单的设计，能为游戏初期的装备增添更多生机与背景故事。工具的氧化程度能清晰指示你剩余的耐久度。\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/oct\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R2meelb.png\" width=\"400\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/oxidizing-copper-tool\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qp0TljH.png\" width=\"400\"/>\n  </a>\n</div>",
